"P187189458" "Manticore summoned a group of Vindicators to meet up with him in Siren's Call. It is possible that this is the moment when a man's fate will decide a world's future. <br><br>Go there and and aid these young Vinidicators. Witness the unraveling of history as a single string of fate's cloth is pulled to the point of breaking."
// AcceptString :
"P4164897135" "Meet up with Vindicators"
// SendOffString :
"P352697334" "Ms. Liberty will be leading them at this time. Join up with her and her little gang of heroes. I believe Manticore will make himself known to them and perhaps reveal his true intentions regarding Arachnos."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1061608094" "Question Manticore"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P574000879" "You need to go back to the point in history when Ms. Liberty meets up with Manticore in Siren's Call. This point in time is crucial."
