"P995265721" "<em No f=a t=3>Sorry, {HeroName}.<em>I have no choice in this. <em>I'm with Arachnos now.<em no t=6>I don't expect you to understand, that's not why I called you here.<em t=7>I expect your defeat to be used as proof to Recluse of my TRUE loyalties.<em attack>Arm yourself."

